<div class="spec-line">Welcome</div>
<h1>Hi, I'm <span>Zoltan</span></h1>

<p class = "lede">
  Definately on the extreme end of the "high effort arts and crafts" spectrum here. So yeah, i built a website. Probably would've been more helpful when I was looking for a job rather than after.. but whatever. But it's alright now it's all for me, i get to make typos and swear, and I'm doing it for me - a much more fun motivator. The drive for this comes mostly out of the "do hard things to get good at doing hard things" motivation - and that being said I am vibe coding most of this. So this main section is going to be vibecode slop that I would feel amiss if I didn't make a personal site, so it gets vibe coded together. Then it brings us to the lab where i'll put more zoltan into it and code cool stuff. The front end will still probably be ai'ed but that's alright, i genually think that's a fair and good use case for the tool. There's some other stuff on the site, and it'll grow and evolve as long as I remain interested in it.
</p>
